# Hill Country is the hills: Dolores Park, at the bottom of the bomb and
# inside the level's box, is one of its exclude boxes (it belongs to the Mission), so the wrong-way
# hint shows there at once, though it is only 15 m from Dolores St; back on the street, it clears.
# Patricia's Green (the Hayes level's seat walls) is past the end of the level's Hayes St box, which
# stops short of Octavia now: the hint shows there too.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run level hills
cmd 100 teleport -233.805 -199.578 9.4 355
cmd 400 teleport -209 -200 9.6 355
cmd 700 teleport -222 430 9.75 0
run 900
expect event levelWrongWay{level=hills} within 100..104
expect event levelBack{level=hills} within 400..404
expect event levelWrongWay{level=hills} within 700..704
expect event levelWrongWay count == 2
